Options to decide between:
- All rights reserved (default if nothing is chosen): people can read the repo but have no right to reuse it.
- MIT or Apache-2.0: maximum reach, anyone can copy and resell.
- CC BY-NC 4.0 for the skills text: free to read and use, no commercial resale.

Until a license is chosen, all rights are reserved by the author.
